---
title: "confirm_with_treasury_cap (Sui Framework: token)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_destruct: ActionRequest destructured
    q_destruct --> q_check_spent: check spent_balance
    q_check_spent --> q_has_spent: spent_balance.is_some()
    q_has_spent --> q_decrease: treasury_cap.supply_mut().decrease_supply(spent_balance)
    q_decrease --> q_return: supply decreased
    q_check_spent --> q_no_spent: spent_balance.is_none()
    q_no_spent --> q_return: destroy none
    q_return --> [*]: return (name, amount, sender, recipient)

    note right of q_has_spent
        INV-001: TreasuryCap bypasses all policy rules
        INV-002: if spent_balance present, supply is decreased directly
        INV-003: no rule approval checks needed with TreasuryCap
    end note
